  "description": "Fora.Client is an IEEE 1516-2025 HLA Federate Protocol client library for .NET. It provides client-side APIs, shared abstractions, encoding support, generated FP protobuf contracts, and TCP/TLS/WebSocket FP transports for building HLA federates.",
